y"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows June to July and August to September each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. In 2025, July to August on the middle came in at 46% of normal. So far in 2026, the middle shows January to February at 62% and June to July at 117%. Grid 27233 had its driest year in 1965 at 64%.</p>"}
